moverscore_v2.py is the retained evaluation implementation used in the audit.
Upstream project: https://github.com/AIPHES/emnlp19-moverscore
The adjacent LICENSE is retained from that source tree.
This copy uses 1 / (1 + transport distance), not the upstream alternative
1 - transport distance. Keep this scoring convention when reproducing our numbers.
The retained implementation filters subwords/punctuation internally even when
remove_subwords=False is passed. The published calls preserve this behavior.
